micropython.mjs and micropython.wasm are MicroPython 1.29.0's WebAssembly port, PyScript variant, as published
on npm: @micropython/micropython-webassembly-pyscript 1.29.0-6, tarball integrity
sha512-kLwGPJFsLY/2aUPmzZxpvauFSmKc0SlJWVvvEttULR0poVQ6W9HV//1fUJyxrGWAxCVDw9aYqJ0LAog0ZLjYVA==, the two files
unchanged from it:

26cc7a99064a16518ab9a695e848efb248bfce504aee56ae73b2af35f3dcbf8b  micropython.mjs
d5913c9327072e71d3e7a2e9384ea326f7d784bcc2f50a01b602c52bd2bdcafd  micropython.wasm

Below: MicroPython's LICENSE (its top-level file at v1.29.0, with the tree of its third-party licenses), then
the notices of the third-party code this build includes: re1.5 (the re module, BSD 3-clause) and uzlib (the
